.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH stool-dotfile-init 1  "stool-dotfile-init "
.SH NAME
stool\-dotfile\-init \- Clone a Git URL and save configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-dotfile\-init\fR [\fB\-\-branch\fR] [\fB\-\-apply\fR] [\fB\-\-recurse\-submodules\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-recurse\-submodules\fR] [\fB\-\-builtin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIREPO\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clone a Git URL and save configuration
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-branch\fR \fI<BRANCH>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-apply\fR
Deploy after cloning
.TP
\fB\-\-recurse\-submodules\fR
Explicitly enable recursive submodules (the default for new repositories)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-recurse\-submodules\fR
Disable recursive submodule initialization and subsequent updates
.TP
\fB\-\-builtin\fR
Clone using the built\-in Git backend
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIREPO\fR]
Git URL (defaults to dotfile.url saved by stool init)
